{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03AO", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{U} = \\{U_i \\to U\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0003": "$U_{i_0} \\times_U \\ldots \\times_U U_{i_p}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\mathcal{F} \\longmapsto \\check{\\mathcal{C}}^\\bullet(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{F})\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0009": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-cech-functor}\n\\check{\\mathcal{C}}^\\bullet(\\mathcal{U}, -) :\n\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\text{Comp}^{+}(\\textit{Ab})\n\\end{equation}", "REF_0001": "\\ref{derived-definition-complexes-notation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{homology-lemma-cat-cochain-abelian}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7982512a613f06b7972f7efac989f0bf7c6f3e3a5b5dfbffcaf050da4cd300ae", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d94fa460761c8a6e0ad6dfb23af1a37161fa1b2cb9564befec777b336bb0e4b5", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWarning: In this section we work exclusively with abelian presheaves\non a category. The results are completely wrong in the\nsetting of sheaves and categories of sheaves!\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a category. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a family of morphisms with fixed target such that all fibre products\n<MATH_0003> exist in <MATH_0004>.\nLet <MATH_0005> be an abelian presheaf on <MATH_0006>.\nThe construction\n<MATH_0007>\nis functorial in <MATH_0008>. In fact, it is a functor\n<MATH_0009>\nsee\nDerived Categories, Definition <REF_0001>\nfor notation. Recall that the category of bounded below complexes\nin an abelian category is an abelian category, see\nHomology, Lemma <REF_0002>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:31f3bf227e5ebe2725b778511379ebcef98e3def64e249c92cf29c5f96f220e1", "unit_id": "tag:03AO:prose-0001"}
